** MMM0150 - QUALITY INSPECTION HOLD ENTRY MAP
** Captures the inspector's hold reason and ID before MMP0400 stores a
** QUALITY-HOLD record. Same best-effort T/F tagged-line convention as
** MMM9000 -- see dialects/screen module docstring for the map dialect
** used for Mantis screen exports; this is Natural's own map body, parsed
** inline by natural.py's _match_map_body.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 #ORDER-NO (A10)
1 #HOLD-REASON (A30)
1 #INSPECTOR-ID (A8)
END-DEFINE
*
1 T 'Order number:' 01/01
1 F #ORDER-NO (AD=O) 01/16
1 T 'Hold reason:' 02/01
1 F #HOLD-REASON (AD=I) 02/16
1 T 'Inspector ID:' 03/01
1 F #INSPECTOR-ID (AD=I) 03/16
END
